{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06778","headline":"过华阴 · 王昌龄","name":"过华阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云起太华山，云山互明灭。\n东峯始含景，了了见松雪。\n羇人感幽栖，窅暎转奇绝。\n欣然忘所疲，永望吟不辍。\n信宿百余里，出关玩新月。\n何意昨来心，遇物遂迁别。\n人生屡如此，何以肆愉悦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}